"Type to filter by app name, Enter to open" = "输入 App 名过滤，回车打开";
"No matching app" = "没有匹配的 App";
"Open System Settings" = "打开系统设置";
"Finish Arranging" = "完成整理";
"Arrange Items…" = "整理图标…";
"Check for Updates…" = "检查更新…";
"Quit CoffeeBar" = "退出 CoffeeBar";
"Panel: expand the whole hidden section when opening an item" = "面板：打开图标时展开整段隐藏区";

"Accessibility permission is needed to identify and click hidden items. Grant it, then click the cup again." = "需要「辅助功能」权限来识别和点击隐藏的图标。授权后再点一次杯子图标即可。";
"Arranging: ⌘-drag items left of the cup to hide them, then click the cup to finish" = "整理中：按住 ⌘ 把图标拖到杯子左边即隐藏，完成后点杯子收回";
"Click the cup to expand or collapse. ⌘-drag an item left of the cup to hide it, right of it to keep it visible." = "点杯子展开或收起。按住 ⌘ 把图标拖到杯子左边隐藏、右边常显。";
"Clicking the cup opens the panel instead of expanding the menu bar" = "点杯子弹出面板，而不是在菜单栏展开";
"No hidden items. ⌘-drag an item to the left of the cup to hide it." = "没有隐藏的图标。按住 ⌘ 把图标拖到杯子左边即可隐藏。";
"On a display with a notch, open the panel instead" = "刘海屏上改为弹出面板";
"Grant Screen Recording to see the real icons with badges and readings." = "授予屏幕录制权限后，面板里会显示真实的图标（含未读角标、读数）。";
"Grant Screen Recording" = "授予屏幕录制权限";
"Accessibility" = "辅助功能";
"Identify which app each hidden menu bar item belongs to." = "识别每个隐藏图标属于哪个 App。";
"Move menu bar items to hide or reveal them." = "移动菜单栏图标来隐藏或露出它们。";
"Open a hidden item's menu when you click it in the panel." = "在面板里点击隐藏图标时替你打开它的菜单。";
"Screen Recording" = "屏幕录制";
"Show the real menu bar icons in the panel, with unread badges and readings." = "在面板里显示真实的菜单栏图标，包括未读角标和读数。";
"Optional. Without it the panel shows app icons instead." = "可选。没有它面板会改为显示 App 图标。";
"Enable Permissions" = "开启权限";
"CoffeeBar needs the permissions below to manage your menu bar." = "CoffeeBar 需要下面的权限来管理你的菜单栏。";
"Everything stays on your Mac. Nothing is collected or sent anywhere." = "所有数据都留在你的 Mac 上，不会收集或上传任何东西。";
"CoffeeBar works without Screen Recording; the panel just shows app icons instead of the real ones." = "没有屏幕录制权限 CoffeeBar 也能用，只是面板里显示 App 图标而不是真实图标。";
"Quit" = "退出";
"Continue" = "继续";
"Continue in Limited Mode" = "以受限模式继续";
"Permission Granted" = "已授权";
"Grant Permission" = "授予权限";
"If you already declined, turn it on in System Settings, then come back here." = "如果之前点了\"拒绝\"，请到系统设置里手动打开，然后回到这里。";
"If you already declined, turn it on in System Settings. macOS may require relaunching CoffeeBar." = "如果之前点了\"拒绝\"，请到系统设置里手动打开。macOS 可能要求重新启动 CoffeeBar。";
"Relaunch CoffeeBar" = "重新启动 CoffeeBar";
"Permissions…" = "权限…";
